    ],
    "text": "For problem 4, we modify our proposals considering of fishing restrictions in territorial water. Based on the model in problem 1 and problem 2, all the herring would enter the territory of Danish in 2035. Under the new restrictions, the time of changing into new fishing mode should happen in 2036 rather than 2045, resulting in losing money for small companies."
  },
